# Egress allowlist (tinyproxy FilterExtended, default-deny). Each line is a POSIX
# extended regex matched against the CONNECT host. Anchored at BOTH ends so a
# domain can only match itself or a subdomain — NOT a suffix-attached lookalike
# (audit M7): "^(.*\.)?pypi\.org$" matches pypi.org and files.pypi.org but
# rejects evilpypi.org, which the old unanchored "\.?pypi\.org$" let through.
^(.*\.)?api\.anthropic\.com$
^(.*\.)?registry\.npmjs\.org$
^(.*\.)?pypi\.org$
^(.*\.)?files\.pythonhosted\.org$
